Code strings discovered in <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">iOS 27</a> suggest that Apple may be planning to show users a break reminder after especially long <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a> AI conversations.<br/>
